<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound rose in a quiet private-sector market on Sunday to between 7-1/2 and 8-1/2 percent from between 6-1/2 and 7-1/2 percent on Wednesday, before the Moslem feast of Eid al-Adha.</p>
<p>Bankers quoted one-week rates between eight and nine percent, compared to between 6-1/2 and 7-1/2 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>$1=3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
